  "topic": "9.1 • GRAND REVISION",
  "body": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px; width: 100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #111111; padding: 4px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n      9.1 • Certification Revision\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      Core Foundations <hlt>Review</hlt>\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #222222; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 640px;\">\n      Review every fundamental milestone before attempting the final 30-question exam and capstone algorithm challenges!\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"background: #fde047; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px #111111; border-radius: 4px; padding: 18px;\">\n      <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n        1. Output & Memory\n      </span>\n      <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">print() & Variables</h3>\n      <ul style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; margin-left: 16px; line-height: 1.4;\">\n        <li><code>print(\"Text\")</code> for strings, <code>print(123)</code> for numbers.</li>\n        <li>Variables store data: <code>name = \"Val\"</code>.</li>\n        <li>Reassignment replaces memory: <code>x = 1</code> then <code>x = 2</code>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background: #93c5fd; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px #111111; border-radius: 4px; padding: 18px;\">\n      <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n        2. Math & Strings\n      </span>\n      <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">BODMAS & Concatenation</h3>\n      <ul style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; margin-left: 16px; line-height: 1.4;\">\n        <li>Operators: <code>+</code>, <code>-</code>, <code>*</code>, <code>/</code>, <code>//</code>, <code>%</code>, <code>**</code>.</li>\n        <li>Brackets <code>()</code> control precedence order.</li>\n        <li>String join: <code>\"A\" + \" \" + \"B\"</code> = <code>\"A B\"</code>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
}